{"action":"enable_pk_memory","cost_tier":"light","description":"Adaptive product-key sparse memory on layers [1,5,7]: query = hidden state + local n-gram context, two 2048-entry sub-key codebooks, top-16 of the cartesian product over 4.19M slots/layer, softmax-weighted values injected into the attention value path through a ZERO-INIT gate (step-0 identity with the SOTA). Per-layer separate memories (sharing measurably hurt). 4.84B params, +17GB VRAM. Rationale: learned routing puts RELATED contexts in a shared slot -- something random hashing cannot do; brute-force hash capacity is measurably saturating (384x gave only -0.0006).","duration":{"type":"full_run"},"fingerprint":"26baab8dec9c7e08","implementation":{"entrypoint":"train.py env NGRAM_TABLE_MULT + NGRAM_FOURGRAM_MULT","test":"tests/test_baseline_training_spec.py"},"intervention_id":"int_pk_memory_default","name":"SOTA + PK memory (default router LR)","parameters":{"env":{"DOC_MASK":"1","DOC_MASK_MODE":"seg","NGRAM_PK_MEMORY":"1","NGRAM_STATE_ROWWISE":"1","NGRAM_TABLE_MULT":"256","WARMDOWN_RATIO":"0.75"}},"reversible":true,"safety":{"fast_fail_nonfinite_loss":true,"max_train_loss":100,"validation_policy_control":false,"vram_note":"256x (~57GB) + seg mask (negligible); fits."},"status":"available","tags":["pk_memory","retrieval","architecture","explore"],"target":{"selector":"SOTA + NGRAM_PK_MEMORY=1","type":"model_architecture"},"timing":{"stage":"model_construction"},"version":1}
{"action":"enable_pk_memory_low_router_lr","cost_tier":"light","description":"Same PK memory but PK_MEM_LR_SCALE=0.25. The router (sub-keys + context embeddings) trains at the aggressive 0.6 embedding LR under AdamW; early routing thrash is the classic product-key failure mode and was flagged as the most likely reason for a null. This arm tests that directly.","duration":{"type":"full_run"},"fingerprint":"4dc3d8256004ace9","implementation":{"entrypoint":"train.py env NGRAM_TABLE_MULT + NGRAM_FOURGRAM_MULT","test":"tests/test_baseline_training_spec.py"},"intervention_id":"int_pk_memory_lr025","name":"SOTA + PK memory (router LR x0.25)","parameters":{"env":{"DOC_MASK":"1","DOC_MASK_MODE":"seg","NGRAM_PK_MEMORY":"1","NGRAM_STATE_ROWWISE":"1","NGRAM_TABLE_MULT":"256","PK_MEM_LR_SCALE":"0.25","WARMDOWN_RATIO":"0.75"}},"reversible":true,"safety":{"fast_fail_nonfinite_loss":true,"max_train_loss":100,"validation_policy_control":false,"vram_note":"256x (~57GB) + seg mask (negligible); fits."},"status":"available","tags":["pk_memory","retrieval","lr","explore"],"target":{"selector":"SOTA + NGRAM_PK_MEMORY=1 PK_MEM_LR_SCALE=0.25","type":"model_architecture"},"timing":{"stage":"model_construction"},"version":1}
